{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/35304-machineiv-help-fund","id":35304,"title":"Machineiv help fund.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-22T19:48:12-08:00","id":35304,"title":"Machineiv help fund.","content":"As some people may be aware, David Hill's (machineiv) home was burglarized earlier this evening. David and his family are ok but the thief/thieves took their computers as part of the theft. I'm posting a link to Dave's gofundme page, it was originally set up for a different project but it would be great if the community could help out one of our own. I'm posting this because David is one of the nicest people I know and it is terrible that it happened so close to Christmas and an upcoming move overseas. He has not asked for this to be posted, I'm doing this on my own initiative to help someone I both like and respect.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.gofundme.com/creativeadventures\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://images.gofundme.com/mdtwkQmGistrISJvocyLd4a0_cs=/1200x900/https://2dbdd5116ffa30a49aa8-c03f075f8191fb4e60e74b907071aee8.ssl.cf1.rackcdn.com/848456_1386607293.1725.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.gofundme.com/creativeadventures\" target=\"_blank\"> Donate to Creative Adventures in Japan, organized by David Hill </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.gofundme.com/creativeadventures\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.gofundme.com/creativeadventures </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> EDIT: Right before we launched this campaign, our house was broken into. Our computers stolen.&hellip; David Hill needs your support for Creative Adventures in Japan </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <span style=\"font-family:georgia\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Onyx Path Forum Administrator</b></span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">Posts in this color are moderator posts</span></b></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this color mean a Great Old One has driven me mad.</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11-darksider","name":"Darksider","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11_2.jpeg","title":"Forum Administrator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1692"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-22T20:22:50-08:00","id":35327,"title":"","content":"You can also pick up some of their excellent creator owned RPGs from their company <a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/browse.php?manufacturers_id=2898&amp;src=WWMMM\" target=\"_blank\">Machine Age Productions</a> at DriveThruRPG . So, you can support some very creative folks and get yourself some cool games in the process.<br /> <br /> I'm a big fan of Maschine Zeit myself and highly recommend it.<br /> <br /> -MMM","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Owner/Editor - FlamesRising.com","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/949-matt-m-mcelroy","name":"Matt-M-McElroy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/co